\pard\b\fs20 Burning Skies\b0\par
\fs16\par
The clans Rustuff and McClomby have entrenched themselves in their sky fortresses.\par
With rockets and all kinds of weapons and tactics, each tries to wipe out the other.\par
A good defense against rockets, with crossbows and anti-aircraft guns, is just as important as a compact infrastructure and fortified home bases.\par
Empty barrels sell for the price of oil barrels, fuel, rockets, weapons and raw materials are resupplied quickly, and an automatic money supply keeps the war chest well filled.\par
